      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S REGAL (2) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (22.15) in a Grade 4/5 at this track last time out. Safe beginner who should be prominent to the first bend. Look for sharp improvement here. BOOM TWO DOWN (1) is mixing form, finishing out of the placings latest but was a winner three back and returns to Q Lakeside this time where he has performed well. Safe beginner and drawn well on the inside. Has the ability and can find best this time. CLASSY HUNTER (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (35.61) in a Grade 5 at Q Parklands. Has ability and can measure up. GO WILD BLUE (7) warrants respect following a recent placing in a tight finish.",
